---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | 16-0 Play" description="How 16-0 Play handles browser data, game submissions, analytics, advertising and contact messages.">
  <Fragment slot="head"><link rel="canonical" href="https://16-0play.com/privacy-policy/" /></Fragment>
  <article class="w-full px-6 py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-ink)] sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--color-body)]">This page explains what information may be handled when you use 16-0 Play and the choices available to you.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[var(--color-mute)]">Last updated <time datetime="2026-09-29">September 29, 2026</time></p>
      </header>

      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-10 text-base leading-7 text-[var(--color-body)]">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Information the game uses</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Game progress and your display preference may be saved in your browser so you can return to a game and keep your chosen theme. The site stores this information in local storage on your device.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">If you submit a run to the leaderboard, the game sends a generated player identifier and handle together with run details such as mode, results, date and settings. The leaderboard stores and displays run information so players can compare results.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Multiplayer mode uses Pusher to connect players and share the game information needed for a live room, such as room membership, player names and game events.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Analytics and advertising</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">The site loads Google Analytics to measure visits and use of the site. Google Analytics may use cookies or similar identifiers and receive information about your browser, device and interactions.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">The site also loads Google AdSense. Google and its advertising partners may use cookies, web beacons, network addresses or similar technologies to serve and measure ads, subject to your settings and applicable requirements.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Learn how <a class="font-medium text-[var(--color-link)] underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-[var(--color-link-deep)]" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google uses information from sites and apps that use its services</a>, and review <a class="font-medium text-[var(--color-link)] underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-[var(--color-link-deep)]" href="https://support.google.com/adsense/answer/7549925" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">how AdSense uses cookies</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Contact messages</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">If you use the contact form, the name, email address and message you provide are sent through FormSubmit to our contact inbox. FormSubmit processes the submission to deliver it. You can also contact us directly by email.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Hosting and service providers</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">The site is hosted using Cloudflare Pages. The services described above may process technical information, including network or device information, to deliver their features, protect their systems or operate the site. Their handling of information is governed by their own policies.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Your choices</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">You can clear local storage or cookies through your browser settings; doing so may remove saved game progress or your theme preference. You can also adjust advertising and cookie controls offered by Google and your browser. Blocking a service may affect related site features.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Changes and questions</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We may update this policy when the site or its services change. The date at the top shows when the current version was last revised. For a privacy question or request, email <a class="font-medium text-[var(--color-link)] underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-[var(--color-link-deep)]" href="mailto:curatedclass13@gmail.com">curatedclass13@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

